      "source": "reading.text",
      "tts_text": "On Saturday, a new family arrived for the school's open day. Their daughter was at school for the first time, so a student guide met them at the main building. A notice near the entrance listed the canteen, chapel, and lecture hall. The family first visited a classroom, then the classroom used by the science club. They waited in the courtyard while the caretaker unlocked a second building. Admission was free, but visitors needed a badge. At lunchtime, they ate in the canteen and asked about the dormitory. By the end of the tour, the daughter knew which building she would visit on Monday.",
